# TC-A10 pricing-axis probes — staging (build 2176e29e) vs local fix (build dev)

## Staging: POST /api/pricing-tables, class-only payload (admin role)
(a) {"customerId":2,"routeId":12,"price":2450000,"vehicleSizeClassId":4,"effectiveDate":"2026-10-16"}
    -> 400 {"error":"Chỉ được chọn một trục giá: loại xe, loại container, hoặc để trống (áp dụng chung)"}
(b) same + "rateKey":"5T" -> 400 same message
(c) same + explicit nulls -> 400 same message
(f) eff date 2027-01-01 -> 400 same message
(g) routeId 6 (no pricing rows) -> 400 same message
(d) class-only + customerId 99999 (bogus) -> 400 'Khách hàng không tồn tại hoặc đã ngưng dùng'  <= guard PASSED, failed later => throw site is downstream (governed apply re-runs beforeCreate on denormalized data)
(e) container-only (containerTypeId 4) -> 201 (id 100, general-vs-container axis unaffected)

## Root cause
crud-factory POST runs beforeCreate (validate + denormalize stamps rateKey=class code),
then the governed apply (price-config-governance.service applyGovernedCreate) re-runs
beforeCreate on that denormalized payload; validatePricingSelector treated
vehicleSizeClassId + rateKey as TWO axes -> 400 on every class-linked create.
Update path: on-disk class rows already carry the pair, so the merged beforeUpdate shape fails the same guard.

## Local retest with fix (backend :3002, build dev, governed path)
POST class-only -> 201 {"id":1915,"rateKey":"E5T59789058","vehicleSizeClassId":512}
PUT  price change (If-Unmodified-Since) -> 200 {"price":"124000","rateKey":"E5T59789058","vehicleSizeClassId":512}
DELETE cleanup -> 200
